        <p><strong>We diagnose AdBlue injector faults, replace dosing modules and restore emissions systems to pass MOT checks.</strong></p>
        <h2>Why choose our AdBlue Solutions in Marden?</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Certified technicians with specialised tools.</li>
          <li>Transparent pricing and upfront diagnostics.</li>
          <li>Mobile callouts and in-workshop repairs.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>What we do</h3>
        <p>We provide diagnostics, repairs, part replacement and software tuning where applicable. Our work includes post-service validation and free follow-up checks.</p>

        <h3>Frequently Asked Questions</h3>
        <dl class="faq">
          <dt>What is AdBlue and why does it fail?</dt><dd>AdBlue is an SCR additive; failures are often due to injector faults, crystallisation or sensor issues.</dd>
<dt>How quickly can you diagnose a fault?</dt><dd>Most diagnostics are completed same-day; repairs may require parts.</dd>
<dt>Do you offer mobile visits?</dt><dd>Yes — we offer mobile callouts across Canterbury and nearby towns.</dd>
        </dl>

        <p><a class="btn btn-primary btn-large" href="/contact.html">Request a Quote</a> <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="tel:07546371963">Call Us</a></p>
